\pard\b\fs20 Year 1: Preparations in the Teudoburg Forest\b0\par
\fs16\par
A few days ago a messenger came from our neighboring tribe, the Cloths. His village fell victim to a Cloman road! Only now do we grasp the full extent of the catastrophe that lies ahead of us! Now is the time to seek allies and helpers to build the "spaceship"! But we will achieve nothing if our homeland falls, too. That is why YOU have now been charged with laying the foundation for our great task.\par
\par
\b Goal:\b0\par
Build a guardroom, an ironworks, a smithy and a town.\par
